# Git and release actions

Do not do any of the following unless the user explicitly asks:

- create a git commit
- increment the version number (or edit version/metainfo release entries)
- push to GitHub (or any remote)

Implement and leave local changes ready for review. Wait for a clear request before committing, versioning, or pushing.
